OL,3,GNEWSAFormer Blackpool hotel fenced off
OL,4,Aover safety fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former hotel and neighbouring
OL,7,Fbuildings in Blackpool have been fenced
OL,8,Foff amid concerns they pose a danger to
OL,9,Fpedestrians.
OL,11,FThe Pennine Hotel on Central Drive,
OL,12,Fnear Havelock Street, has been
OL,13,Fdeteriorating for several years, with
OL,14,Fits windows now boarded up.
OL,16,FBlackpool Council said it was taking
OL,17,Fsteps to make the buildings safe.
OL,19,FIt said the cost of the work would be
OL,20,Frecovered from the owners.
